      "AZOLIN - LF\n(Azospirillum lipoferum)\nAzospirillum is a beneficial nitrogen-fixing\nbacterium used as a biofertilizer to improve\nplant growth and soil health.\nBenefits:\n• Converts atmospheric nitrogen into\nammonia.\n• Reduces the cost of chemical nitrogen\nfertilizers.\n• Produces plant growth hormones like\nauxins, gibberellins, and cytokinins.\n• Improves tolerance to abiotic stress\nand increases soil nitrogen levels.\n• Enhances vegetative growth and\noverall productivity. Improves seed\ngermination.\n• Improves soil microflora and overall\nsoil fertility.",
