      "AZOTOLIN - LF\n(Azotobacter Chroococcum)\nAzotobacter Chroococcum is a free living\naerobic bacterium by fixing atmospheric\nnitrogen into ammonia in soil.\nBenefits:\n• fixes atmospheric nitrogen into\nammonia supplying it to plant roots.\n• Enhances root proliferation and early\nplant\n• Produces antifungal compounds that\nprotect against plant diseases and act\nas benefical soil conditioner.\n• Produces growth promoting\nsubstances like Auxins, Gibberellins\nand Cytokinins.\n• Reduces the cost of chemical nitrogen\nfertilizer.",
