      "RHIZOLIN - LF\n(Rhizobium spp)\nRhizobium is a genus of symbiotic Nitrogen-\nfixing bacteria that forms nodules on the roots\nof leguminous plants. These bacteria live in\nmutual association with their host plant.\nBenefits:\n• Fixes Atmospheric nitrogen inside\nroot nodules and supplies it directly to\nthe plant.\n• Promotes beneficial soil microbial\npopulation.\n• Improves protein content in grains and\npulses.\n• Reduces the cost of chemicals\nnitrogen fertilizer.\n• Boosts roots and shoot growth.\nMode of Action:\nThe Bacteria form nodules in the root",
