      "POTASHLIN - LF\n(Frateuria aurantia)\nFrateuria aurantia is a potash mobilizing\nbiofertilizer that convert insoluble soil\npotassium into a usable form for plant uptake.\nBenefits:\n• It releases immobilized potassium in\nthe soil into an accessible form for\nplant roots.\n• Promotes better root development and\nboosts fruit size, color and yield.\n• Reduces the cost of chemical\npotassium fertilizer.\n• Improves plant resilience to\nenvironmental stresses like drought\nand diseases.\n• Improves seed germination\npercentage and enhances overall\nbiomass.",
