      "ASPERLIN\n(A natural bio-fermentation product)\nAspergillus sp. is highly effective at breaking\ndown unavailable phosphorus, potassium and\nzinc in the soil and converting them into\nsoluble forms for plant uptake.\nBenefits:\n• Increases the solubility of phosphorus,\npotassium and zinc.\n• Produces plant growth hormones like\nIAA and gibberellins, enhancing root\ndevelopment.\n• These fungi secrete proteolytic\nenzymes such as cellulase and\namylase, which accelerate the\ndecomposition of agricultural\nresidues.\n• Improves the photosynthetic capacity\nof plants.",
