      "POTENCY :\nLiquid : 1 × 10⁹ / ml\nPowder : 2 × 10⁸ CFU/g\nDosage :\nLiquid : 500ml - 1000 ml / Acre\nPowder : 3-5 Kgs / Acre\nTarget Diseases :\nRhizoctonia, Pythium, Fusarium,\nSclerotinia, Sclerotium.\nRecommended Crops :\nFor All Crops.\nAPPLICATION\nSoil Application\nDrip irrigation\nSeed Treatment"
