      "BACILIN-LF\n(Bacillus Subtilis)\nBacillus subtilis is a highly effective, eco-\nfriendly biofungicide and bactericide that\npromotes plant growth through rhizobacteria.\nIt is useful for controlling soil-borne and\nfoliar diseases.\nBenefits:\n• Protects plants from bacterial and\nfungal pathogens.\n• Produces antibiotics and enzymes that\nsuppress harmful microbes.\n• Promotes stronger root systems.\n• Enhances nutrient solubilization.\n• Induces systemic resistance against\nbiotic (pathogens) and abiotic stress\n(drought, salinity).\n• Heat-resistant spores make it effective\nfor field application.",
      "POTENCY :\nLiquid : 1 × 10⁹ / ml\nPowder : 1 × 10⁸ CFU/g\nDosage :\nLiquid : 500ml - 1000 ml / Acre\nPowder : 3-5 Kgs / Acre\nMode of Action:\nProduces bioactive compounds,\nlipopeptides, and cell-wall degrading\nenzymes that suppress harmful bacteria and\nfungi.\nTarget Diseases:\nAnthracnose, Leaf spots, Fusarium\nwilt, Pythium, Rhizoctonia, Botrytis.\nRecommended Crops:\nAll Crops.\nAPPLICATION\nSoil Application\nDrip irrigation\nFoliar Spray"
