      "POTENCY :\nLiquid : 1 × 10⁹ / ml\nPowder : 1 × 10⁸ CFU/g\nDosage :\nLiquid : 500ml - 1000 ml / Acre\nPowder : 3-5 Kgs / Acre\nTarget Diseases:\nPowdery mildew, B o t r y t i s ,\nSclerotinia, Fusarium, Rhizoctonia,\nPythium, Phytophthora.\nRecommended Crops:\nAll Crops.\nAPPLICATION\nSoil Application\nDrip irrigation\nFoliar Spray"
