      "BIO COMPOSTER\n(Combination of Compost Microorganisms)\n• Benefits :\n• Decomposition using Bio composter is an odourless\nprocess.\n• It quickens the process of decomposition of the\ncompost.\n• ĉe compost is completely decomposed when Bio\ncomposter is used.\n• It is effective under various environmental\nconditions.\n• It contains high quality final product which is an\nexcellent soil conditioner.\n• It lowers risk of pollution by chemical fertilizers.\nMode of Action:\nCompost microorganisms consist of\nbeneficial bacteria, fungi, and actinomycetes that\nactively decompose organic residues during the\ncomposting process. These microbes secrete enzymes\nthat break down complex organic materials such as\ncrop residues, animal waste, and plant biomass into",
      "POTENCY :\nLiquid : 1 × 10⁸ / ml\nDosage :\nLiquid : 1Ltr 1000 Kgs of compost.\nsimpler, stable organic matter. During decomposition,\nthey convert nutrients into plant-available forms,\nimprove the carbon–nitrogen balance, and suppress\nharmful pathogens through competitive activity. The\ncontinuous action of compost microorganisms\naccelerates compost maturity, enhances humus\nformation, improves soil structure, increases microbial\ndiversity, and ultimately enriches soil fertility,\nsupporting healthy plant growth and sustainable\nagriculture.\nDirections for use :\nMix 1 Litre of Bio Composter in 200 Litres of water\nper 1000 kgs of Compost.\n• Spray once in 15 days for 3 times"
