      "POTENCY :\nLiquid : 1 x 10⁸ / ml\noxygen, thereby reducing the formation of\nfoul-smelling gases like hydrogen sulfide\nand ammonia.\nContinuous microbial activity minimizes\nsludge buildup, controls bad odours,\nimproves waste degradation efficiency, and\nhelps maintain a cleaner and healthier\nenvironment in drains, septic tanks, effluent\ntreatment plants, and waste handling\nsystems.\n• Directions for use :\n• Mix 500 ml of sep clean in 5 ltrs of\nwater and flush down in to the toilet.\nUse sep clean once in 6 months.\n• The similar process to be followed\nmonthly to keep the septic tanks free of\ntroubles.\n• 500 ml Sep clean is adequate for septic\ntanks of 5000 Its capacity."
