      "SUDOLIN\nIt controls crops from soil borne diseases, stem rots, seedling rots, leaf rot, leaf curl, blast,\nwilt etc.\nNEMATOLIN\nNematolin helps to control the worms in the soil. as the worms in the soil tend to\ndecompose the roots. ĉese decomposed roots pave the way for the growth of poisonous\nfungi that contaminate the root vegetables. ĉese vegetables cause various diseases. As\nthe Nematolin destroys the worms and aids in the growth of the crops, we get better yields\nfrom the crops\nTRICHOLIN\nTricolin is an eco-friendly bio control agent. Mycoparasites produce cell wall degrading\nenzymes which allow them to bore holes with other fungus and extract nutrients for their\nown growth. It controls root rot, Rhizome rot, wilt, Red rot, stem rot, Damping off, Blight\nBlasts, leaf spots, etc.\nACTINOLIN\nWhen applied in soil drench, the beneficial bacteria colonize around the plant roots in\nthe rhizosphere to control seedling rot, root rot, leaf curl from a defensive barrier. It\ncontrols seedling rot, root rot, leafspot, powdery mildew, & botrytis. And produces\nseveral byprod ucts to aid in plant health including siderophores, chitinase and anti-\nbiotics. It also Strengthens the soil and its micro organisms.\nBOSCOR - G\nBOSCOR-G is a very safe and eco friendly Bio product. Increases total crop yield. Increases\ngermination and viability of Seeds. Stimulates development of micro flora population in soil.\nImproves speedy translocation of micro and macro Nutrients. Increases the quality of flowers,\nvegetables, fruits, spices and grains. Stimulates root formation, growth and water absorption.\nIncreases colour, taste, weight and flavour of products. Increases the growth rate of plants. Helps\nplants to survive in drought."
